Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:34.92,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}我的心撲通撲通
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:37.89,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3}跳個不停
